From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:35:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 12/39] bitproxy: ask about new apps, re-resolve on
 install/remove

While the VPN runs, BitProxy listens for package installs and removals:
- a new app (non-system, uses INTERNET, no saved choice) gets a
  notification 'Route <app> through VPN or Direct?' with VPN / Direct
  actions that save the choice and re-apply;
- a reinstalled app with a saved choice is re-applied with its new uid;
- an uninstalled app's rule is dropped while its saved choice is kept.
Re-applies are batched (3 s) and only touch the BitProxy profile.
